  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/DivendresOndaSummerContest-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px;\">69 fotos del inicio de la s&eacute;ptima edici&oacute;n la tarde de este viernes del Onda Summer Contest, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px;\">que </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/HorarisOSC.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 477px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px;\">tomar&aacute; fuerza la tarde de este s&aacute;bado, con las finales, previstas hasta las 21.30 horas, en el Skate Park municipal de la calle Segorbe, junto al parque comarcal de bomberos y el Centro de Emergencias.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skateparkdivendres/img_1118.jpg\" alt=\"img_1118\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skateparkdivendres/img_1120.jpg\" alt=\"img_1120\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skateparkdivendres/img_1123.jpg\" alt=\"img_1123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skateparkdivendres/img_1124.jpg\" alt=\"img_1124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skateparkdivendres/img_1126.jpg\" alt=\"img_1126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skateparkdivendres/img_1133.jpg\" alt=\"img_1133\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/skat